    Bug 1913580 - Part 4: Update front-end gSpacesToolbar to handle tabProperties instead of just the url for extension spaces. r=mkmelin

    Removes the `url` property from front-end's `NativeButtonProperties`
    type and make all relevant front-end functions properly handle the URL
    through `tabProperties`.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D229900

